(2) n. of a kind of tree (in Skt. Lexx. applied to several trees; Pkt. kaṃcana, m., acc. to Sheth a kind [] of tree): Māy 〔258.10〕 (mahāvṛkṣa); MSV 〔i.286.10〕; MPS 〔49.25〕.

Kāñcanamālā,
(1) n. of the wife of Kunāla: Divy 〔406.19〕; 〔413.3, 22〕;
(2) n. of an apsaras: Kv 〔3.14〕.
